script = ExtResource("1_dqwda")
clue_text = "I've tried to leave this house.

Every door leads me back.

He hides the truth inside a rusted box.

I found the key once.

He made sure I forgot where.

He's watching.

 REMEMBER

Four walls, One door, Three knocks.
"

